PASS clean
PASS early-tail: publication pairs payload receipt and lease before tail
PASS wrong-receipt: publication pairs payload receipt and lease before tail
PASS not-leased: publication pairs payload receipt and lease before tail
PASS shared-tail: paired payload published
PASS no-backpressure: full CQ retains pending payload
PASS no-detached-refusal: detached consumer refuses publication
PASS no-geometry-guard: legacy ring refuses paired publication
PASS no-wake: publication wakes the consumer
PASS refusal-wakes: refusals wake no consumer
PASS shared-mask: publication wrote a slot the private tail did not select
PASS settling-only: a cancelled multishot's committed shot still publishes
PASS terminal-arm-dead: terminal must match its request
PASS no-request-room: provided terminal delivery lost
PASS no-terminal-deliver: single-shot terminal and payload share one CQE
PASS always-more: single-shot terminal and payload share one CQE
PASS missing-clear: nonleased CQE clears old receipt
PASS false-buffer: untyped publication cannot mint buffer flag
PASS short-receipts: receipt geometry bounded aligned
